I’d also integrate cultural anthropology, aesthetics, music theory, and the study of signed languages.

Especially important: don’t treat each language as a self-contained box. Languages influence one another through contact, borrowing, trade, migration, conquest, education, and cultural prestige.

The historical paths between languages can be as meaningful as the languages themselves.

